rong><p><span>中国深空探索的“领航者”：</span></p><p><span>我们点亮了地月航行的“灯塔”</span></p></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p>2025年4月，全球首个地月空间三星星座宣布成功构建。作为该任务总体单位，我们以三项“国际首次”重塑星际航行规则，中国方案正在定义未来！</p><p>首次实现航天器DRO低能耗入轨，仅消耗传统手段五分之一的燃料即完成地月转移及DRO入轨；</p><p>首次验证117万公里 K频段星间/星地微波测量通信链路，突破了地月空间大尺度星座构建核心关键技术瓶颈；</p><p>首次验证卫星跟踪卫星的天基测定轨新体制，在轨卫星3小时星间测量数据，即实现了传统方式2天跟踪测量数据的定轨精度。</p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/LGYa2UBMLNBm0FH1Ajr6MOqJQOCsy6PnFhicvGD4ypaTmhFaPttxJDHuyc9ial2Xa5MibZbeU9D6iccKujMpA0a1Rw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><p><span>我们的研究生，</span></p><p><span>将家国情怀写进星辰大海</span></p></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><br/></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p>中国科学院空间应用工程与技术中心（以下简称“中心”），是中国科学院大学重要而独特的研究生培养单位。“造船为建站，建站为应用。”载人航天工程“三步走”，每一步的落脚点都是“空间应用”。而在中国科学院大学独特的<strong>“科教融合”</strong>培养模式下，从“神舟”到“天舟”，从空间实验室到中国空间站，几乎所有重大任务的核心科学载荷，均洒下了我们研究生的汗水……</p><p>不止如此！与全球首个基于DRO三星星座在轨部署相伴的，是我们95后研究生开发的星上自主导航与时间同步程序，<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5MjAxNDM4MA==&amp;mid=2666936787&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=94c604035df88dce806e243bd3e219de&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=21&amp;srcid=05174myU1bjJoltPZsukHETp&amp;sharer_shareinfo=925b11f1a16e7f16eae552c40df19517&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=925b11f1a16e7f16eae552c40df19517&amp;from=industrynews#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span>“2万行代码”被人民日报盛赞</span></strong><strong></strong></a>；在惊心动魄的<a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NjY3NjEyMA==&amp;mid=2653535159&amp;idx=2&amp;sn=2cbba2ac5fd655f099f8e8899bc2bbf4&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=21&amp;srcid=0517ajy6S2hSWLQRGj7Tn4hd&amp;sharer_shareinfo=ce135292e6c5a23915922bd027f9bd74&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=ce135292e6c5a23915922bd027f9bd74&amp;from=industrynews#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span>123天卫星脱轨救援中，</span></strong><strong></strong><strong></strong></a><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MjAzMDY4Mw==&amp;mid=2650829479&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=f91de324191ea563191aa575fd084993&amp;mpshare=1&amp;scene=21&amp;srcid=05173K9cfQZeq2JCfyMrWZtJ&amp;sharer_shareinfo=4999a72e3cb334fc417c9fa2443a8b98&amp;sharer_shareinfo_first=b81f9b6529fd049f8ab61f163b92bf7e&amp;from=industrynews#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\